{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】荃灣一名女子遭折斷的樹椏壓傷。</p>\n<p>大樹位於山坡上面，約有20米高，塌下的樹椏大約5米長，樹枝及樹葉散落地上。消防員到場架起雲梯，將有倒塌危險的樹椏移除。</p>\n<p>警方中午12時左右接報，一名女子在石圍角邨石荷樓對開巴士站遭折斷的樹椏砸中，頭部受傷送往瑪嘉烈醫院救治。現場一段石圍角路部分行車線一度封閉。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:01.130289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:14:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.664703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:49.787375+00:00","content_hash":"2c311b1b877ed8a5aa92640277fac59d4917af62abcadbad01190ac0bd4573a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:01.130289+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}